//SETUP    JOB (R360,SETUP),'RELIEF360 SETUP',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X,
//             NOTIFY=&SYSUID
//*-------------------------------------------------------------------*
//* SYSTEM:      RELIEF360 - EMERGENCY RELIEF ALLOCATION
//* JOB NAME:    SETUP
//* DESCRIPTION: ALLOCATES BASE PHYSICAL SEQUENTIAL (PS) DATASETS,
//*              PARTITIONED DATASETS (PDS), AND GENERATION DATA GROUP
//*              (GDG) BASES FOR THE RELIEF360 BATCH SYSTEM.
//*
//* LEAD:        ANANYA (JCL & BATCH LEAD)
//* INTEGRATION: SIDDHI
//*
//* NOTE:        THIS IS A PHASE 0 IMPLEMENTATION PLACEHOLDER.
//*              ACTUAL SPACE PARAMETERS AND SITE-SPECIFIC VOLUMES
//*              WILL BE CONFIGURED IN PHASE 1.
//*-------------------------------------------------------------------*
//ALLOC01  EXEC PGM=IEFBR14
//* PLANNED DATASET ALLOCATION STEP
//* DD STATEMENTS WILL ALLOCATE:
//* <HLQ>.RELIEF360.INPUT
//* <HLQ>.RELIEF360.OUTPUT
//* <HLQ>.RELIEF360.EXCEPTIONS
//* <HLQ>.RELIEF360.REPORTS
//SYSIN    DD DUMMY
//
